        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/Greedy/mission_raccoon/scene_raccoon_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 799e5b66-b968-4ecf-b2f5-a99a892138fe).Image",
        "Description": "Your targets are Ruby Red, renowned journalist, and her informant Nicole Samson. Red is seen as a great investigative journalist by the public, but most of her stories are fabricated, she is responsible for several kidnappings, murders and other scandals in order to then uncover them, framing others and putting herself in the spotlight. They plan to meet at the Milton-Fitzpatrick Bank in New York to &quot;expose&quot; a rival bank to manipulate the stock market and rid the bank&apos;s competition.",
